solution: enable airplane mode then enable wifi,
open browser to visit a website
then disable airplane mode, and it will stay 
connected to the wifi
reason: it seems to prevent auto-connecting to trusted networks if it can't see
any internet on the network


the real reason is when wifi is on, it will visit https://www.google.com/generate_204 to determinate
if the network has internet

but google.com is not available in some area
so change it

adb shell settings put global captive_portal_https_url https://www.google.cn/generate_204
adb shell settings put global captive_portal_http_url http://www.google.cn/generate_204
adb shell settings put global captive_portal_fallback_url http://g.cn/generate_204
adb shell settings put global captive_portal_other_fallback_urls http://www.qualcomm.cn/generate_204

you may only need this
adb shell settings put global captive_portal_https_url https://www.qualcomm.cn/generate_204

or
adb shell
settings put global captive_portal_http_url http://connect.rom.miui.com/generate_204
settings put global captive_portal_https_url https://connect.rom.miui.com/generate_204

or use
adb shell
su
settings get gloabl captive_portal_server
settings put global captive_portal_server "connectivitycheck.gstatic.com"
